    "what_changed": "Two evidence directories (orchestrator investigation; March census), replay programs and metrics with recorded hashes, tooling for modal G-code metrics, bundle census, claim reachability and ledger generation, and 51 tests that pin hashes, the 702 baseline, the disposition and census integrity.",
    "why_not_redundant": "No prior record tested the archived orchestrator against the defect or established that 702 (not 780) is the reproducible count; no prior census compared the March bundles to Git by content hash or checked 'complete' claims for reachability. The CL-RED premise is corrected by erratum rather than built on."
  },
